e dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><h3 data=
-start=3D"0" data-end=3D"26"><strong data-start=3D"4" data-end=3D"26">Probl=
em Statement:</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"28" data-end=3D"447">In the era of digital entertainment, =
users are presented with an overwhelming number of movie choices across var=
ious streaming platforms. This abundance often leads to <strong data-start=
=3D"196" data-end=3D"216">decision fatigue</strong>, where users struggle t=
o choose what to watch next due to the sheer volume of options. The lack of=
 personalized guidance can result in a poor user experience, reduced platfo=
rm engagement, and underutilization of content libraries.</p>
<p data-start=3D"449" data-end=3D"755">The core challenge is to develop a <=
strong data-start=3D"484" data-end=3D"515">movie recommendation system</str=
ong> that can intelligently suggest relevant movies to users based on the <=
strong data-start=3D"585" data-end=3D"638">inherent characteristics of the =
movies themselves</strong>=E2=80=94such as genre, cast, director, plot, lan=
guage, keywords, etc.=E2=80=94even in the absence of extensive user prefere=
nce data.</p>
<p data-start=3D"757" data-end=3D"1086">Such a system should be capable of =
understanding and leveraging <strong data-start=3D"821" data-end=3D"847">co=
ntent-based features</strong> to recommend movies that align closely with t=
he user=E2=80=99s past preferences or a given movie of interest. The goal i=
s to help users discover content they are likely to enjoy, thereby improvin=
g user satisfaction and engagement on the platform.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"1088" data-end=3D"1091">
<h3 data-start=3D"1093" data-end=3D"1116"><strong data-start=3D"1097" data-=
end=3D"1116">Key Objectives:</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"1118" data-end=3D"1462">
<li data-start=3D"1118" data-end=3D"1201">
<p data-start=3D"1121" data-end=3D"1201"><strong data-start=3D"1121" data-e=
nd=3D"1148">Reduce decision fatigue</strong> by offering intelligent, tailo=
red movie suggestions.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1202" data-end=3D"1297">
<p data-start=3D"1205" data-end=3D"1297"><strong data-start=3D"1205" data-e=
nd=3D"1240">Utilize content-based filtering</strong>, focusing on movie att=
ributes rather than user behavior.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1298" data-end=3D"1366">
<p data-start=3D"1301" data-end=3D"1366"><strong data-start=3D"1301" data-e=
nd=3D"1328">Enhance discoverability</strong> of lesser-known but relevant c=
ontent.</p>
