<h3 data-start=3D"2055" data-end=3D"2104">=E2=9C=85 <strong data-start=3D"2=
061" data-end=3D"2104">6. Integrate with Search API (Optional)</strong></h3=
>
<p data-start=3D"2105" data-end=3D"2194">For more robust solutions, especia=
lly in production, integrate external search APIs like:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2195" data-end=3D"2242">
<li data-start=3D"2195" data-end=3D"2210">
<p data-start=3D"2197" data-end=3D"2210">Google Search</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2211" data-end=3D"2242">
<p data-start=3D"2213" data-end=3D"2242">TMDb API (The Movie Database)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"2244" data-end=3D"2315">They can often resolve ambiguous o=
r misspelled inputs based on context.</p>
