ng"><h3 data-start=3D"0" data-end=3D"67">=E2=9C=85 <strong data-start=3D"6"=
 data-end=3D"67">Methodology for Content-Based Movie Recommendation System<=
/strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"69" data-end=3D"270">The <strong data-start=3D"73" data-en=
d=3D"88">methodology</strong> outlines the structured steps taken to develo=
p a content-based movie recommendation system that suggests similar movies =
based on their characteristics (genre, cast, keywords, etc.).</p>
<hr data-start=3D"272" data-end=3D"275">
<h3 data-start=3D"277" data-end=3D"312">=F0=9F=94=B9 <strong data-start=3D"=
284" data-end=3D"312">1. Problem Understanding</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"313" data-end=3D"459">
<li data-start=3D"313" data-end=3D"384">
<p data-start=3D"315" data-end=3D"384">Users face decision fatigue due to t=
he overwhelming number of movies.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"385" data-end=3D"459">
<p data-start=3D"387" data-end=3D"459">Goal: Suggest movies similar to a se=
lected title using content features.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"461" data-end=3D"464">
<h3 data-start=3D"466" data-end=3D"495">=F0=9F=94=B9 <strong data-start=3D"=
473" data-end=3D"495">2. Data Collection</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"496" data-end=3D"653">
<li data-start=3D"496" data-end=3D"541">
<p data-start=3D"498" data-end=3D"541">Use datasets from TMDb, IMDb, or Mov=
ieLens.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"542" data-end=3D"653">
<p data-start=3D"544" data-end=3D"568">Collect features like:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"571" data-end=3D"653">
<li data-start=3D"571" data-end=3D"580">
<p data-start=3D"573" data-end=3D"580">Title</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"583" data-end=3D"592">
<p data-start=3D"585" data-end=3D"592">Genre</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"595" data-end=3D"603">
<p data-start=3D"597" data-end=3D"603">Cast</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"606" data-end=3D"618">
<p data-start=3D"608" data-end=3D"618">Director</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"621" data-end=3D"638">
<p data-start=3D"623" data-end=3D"638">Overview/Plot</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"641" data-end=3D"653">
<p data-start=3D"643" data-end=3D"653">Keywords</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"655" data-end=3D"658">
<h3 data-start=3D"660" data-end=3D"692">=F0=9F=94=B9 <strong data-start=3D"=
667" data-end=3D"692">3. Data Preprocessing</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"693" data-end=3D"939">
<li data-start=3D"693" data-end=3D"722">
<p data-start=3D"695" data-end=3D"722">Handle missing/null values.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"723" data-end=3D"787">
<p data-start=3D"725" data-end=3D"787">Normalize text (lowercase, remove pu=
nctuation and whitespace).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"788" data-end=3D"854">
<p data-start=3D"790" data-end=3D"854">Convert lists (cast, genres, keyword=
s) into clean string format.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"855" data-end=3D"939">
<p data-start=3D"857" data-end=3D"939">Merge relevant fields into one featu=
re column (e.g., a =E2=80=9Ccombined_features=E2=80=9D field).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"941" data-end=3D"944">
<h3 data-start=3D"946" data-end=3D"978">=F0=9F=94=B9 <strong data-start=3D"=
953" data-end=3D"978">4. Feature Extraction</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"979" data-end=3D"1083">
<li data-start=3D"979" data-end=3D"1083">
<p data-start=3D"981" data-end=3D"1028">Convert text data into numerical ve=
ctors using:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1031" data-end=3D"1083">
<li data-start=3D"1031" data-end=3D"1059">
<p data-start=3D"1033" data-end=3D"1059"><strong data-start=3D"1033" data-e=
nd=3D"1054">TF-IDF Vectorizer</strong> or</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1062" data-end=3D"1083">
<p data-start=3D"1064" data-end=3D"1083"><strong data-start=3D"1064" data-e=
nd=3D"1083">CountVectorizer</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1085" data-end=3D"1152">This helps quantify the importance=
 of each word across the dataset.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"1154" data-end=3D"1157">
<h3 data-start=3D"1159" data-end=3D"1195">=F0=9F=94=B9 <strong data-start=
=3D"1166" data-end=3D"1195">5. Similarity Calculation</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1196" data-end=3D"1378">
<li data-start=3D"1196" data-end=3D"1271">
<p data-start=3D"1198" data-end=3D"1271">Use <strong data-start=3D"1202" da=
ta-end=3D"1223">cosine similarity</strong> to compute the closeness between=
 movie vectors.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1272" data-end=3D"1378">
<p data-start=3D"1274" data-end=3D"1378">Build a <strong data-start=3D"1282=
" data-end=3D"1303">similarity matrix</strong> where each cell <code data-s=
tart=3D"1320" data-end=3D"1328">[i][j]</code> represents how similar movie =
<code data-start=3D"1358" data-end=3D"1361">i</code> is to movie <code data=
-start=3D"1374" data-end=3D"1377">j</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1380" data-end=3D"1383">
<h3 data-start=3D"1385" data-end=3D"1418">=F0=9F=94=B9 <strong data-start=
=3D"1392" data-end=3D"1418">6. User Input Handling</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1419" data-end=3D"1592">
<li data-start=3D"1419" data-end=3D"1456">
<p data-start=3D"1421" data-end=3D"1456">Accept a movie title from the user=
.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1457" data-end=3D"1539">
<p data-start=3D"1459" data-end=3D"1539">Use <strong data-start=3D"1463" da=
ta-end=3D"1496"><code data-start=3D"1465" data-end=3D"1494">difflib.get_clo=
se_matches()</code></strong> or fuzzy matching to correct misspellings.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1540" data-end=3D"1592">
<p data-start=3D"1542" data-end=3D"1592">Retrieve the correct movie index f=
rom the dataset.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1594" data-end=3D"1597">
<h3 data-start=3D"1599" data-end=3D"1638">=F0=9F=94=B9 <strong data-start=
=3D"1606" data-end=3D"1638">7. Recommendation Generation</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1639" data-end=3D"1765">
<li data-start=3D"1639" data-end=3D"1688">
<p data-start=3D"1641" data-end=3D"1688">Fetch similarity scores for the se=
lected movie.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1689" data-end=3D"1765">
<p data-start=3D"1691" data-end=3D"1765">Sort and return the top N most sim=
ilar movies (excluding the input movie).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1767" data-end=3D"1770">
<h3 data-start=3D"1772" data-end=3D"1807">=F0=9F=94=B9 <strong data-start=
=3D"1779" data-end=3D"1807">8. Evaluation (Optional)</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1808" data-end=3D"1927">
<li data-start=3D"1808" data-end=3D"1856">
<p data-start=3D"1810" data-end=3D"1856">Manually verify recommendations fo=
r relevance.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1857" data-end=3D"1927">
<p data-start=3D"1859" data-end=3D"1927">Conduct user feedback sessions or =
A/B testing (in deployed systems).</p>
</li>
</ul>
