ut the duration of the project. I am particularly grateful to my mentor, <s=
trong data-start=3D"907" data-end=3D"930">Mr. Abhishek Mishra</strong>, for=
 his invaluable mentorship, timely feedback, and motivation, all of which w=
ere instrumental in shaping and completing this project successfully.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1081" data-end=3D"1508">This project focused on building a=
 dynamic web application capable of recommending movies similar to user pre=
ferences. It employed <strong data-start=3D"1212" data-end=3D"1250">content=
