strong data-start=3D"1336" data-end=3D"1348">OMDb API</strong> to fetch mov=
ie posters, cast information, and overviews. Additional features included a=
 <strong data-start=3D"1437" data-end=3D"1471">movie trailer preview functi=
on</strong> and a <strong data-start=3D"1478" data-end=3D"1507">responsive =
user interface</strong>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1510" data-end=3D"1734">Through this project, I gained pra=
ctical experience in a wide range of technologies including <strong data-st=
