SS</strong>, and <strong data-start=3D"1660" data-end=3D"1679">API integrat=
ion</strong>, along with deploying the application via <strong data-start=
=3D"1722" data-end=3D"1733">Railway</strong>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1736" data-end=3D"1930">I would also like to thank the res=
pected faculty members of the <strong data-start=3D"1800" data-end=3D"1856"=
>Department of Computer Science and Engineering, BPIT</strong>, for their a=
cademic support and encouragement during the training period.</p>
