<hr data-start=3D"114" data-end=3D"117">
<h2 data-start=3D"119" data-end=3D"141">=F0=9F=93=98 <strong data-start=3D"=
125" data-end=3D"141">Introduction</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"143" data-end=3D"515">In today=E2=80=99s digital era, user=
s are overwhelmed by the vast number of movies available across streaming p=
latforms and databases. With countless choices at their fingertips, users o=
ften face <strong data-start=3D"331" data-end=3D"351">decision fatigue</str=
ong> when trying to select what to watch next. This has led to a growing de=
mand for intelligent systems that can help users discover content based on =
their preferences.</p>
<p data-start=3D"517" data-end=3D"968">The <strong data-start=3D"521" data-=
end=3D"552">Movie Recommendation System</strong> aims to address this chall=
enge by providing users with personalized movie suggestions based on the ch=
aracteristics of movies they already like. Unlike traditional recommendatio=
n engines that rely heavily on user ratings or behavior, this project adopt=
s a <strong data-start=3D"808" data-end=3D"844">content-based filtering app=
roach</strong>. It analyzes movie features such as <strong data-start=3D"88=
1" data-end=3D"931">genres, cast, director, keywords, and overview</strong>=
 to compute similarity between films.</p>
<p data-start=3D"970" data-end=3D"1339">By applying <strong data-start=3D"9=
82" data-end=3D"1019">Natural Language Processing (NLP)</strong> techniques=
 like <strong data-start=3D"1036" data-end=3D"1060">TF-IDF vectorization</s=
trong> and <strong data-start=3D"1065" data-end=3D"1086">cosine similarity<=
/strong>, the system identifies and recommends movies with similar content =
to the one provided by the user. It also integrates with the <strong data-s=
tart=3D"1214" data-end=3D"1226">OMDb API</strong> to display relevant movie=
 posters, cast details, and overviews, offering a rich and interactive user=
 experience.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1341" data-end=3D"1676">The system is developed using <str=
ong data-start=3D"1371" data-end=3D"1410">Python, Scikit-learn, Pandas, Fla=
sk</strong>, and other modern tools, and is deployed as a <strong data-star=
t=3D"1457" data-end=3D"1476">web application</strong> to ensure accessibili=
ty and ease of use. This project not only strengthens theoretical knowledge=
 but also demonstrates the real-world application of machine learning and w=
eb development technologies.</p>
