<hr data-start=3D"126" data-end=3D"129">
<h2 data-start=3D"131" data-end=3D"178">=F0=9F=93=8C <strong data-start=3D"=
137" data-end=3D"178">To Add Page Numbers to Your Document:</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"180" data-end=3D"231">=F0=9F=94=B9 Step 1: Open the docum=
ent in Microsoft Word.</h3>
<h3 data-start=3D"233" data-end=3D"287">=F0=9F=94=B9 Step 2: Go to the <str=
ong data-start=3D"258" data-end=3D"268">Insert</strong> tab on the ribbon.<=
/h3>
<h3 data-start=3D"289" data-end=3D"362">=F0=9F=94=B9 Step 3: Click on <stro=
ng data-start=3D"313" data-end=3D"328">Page Number</strong> (in the Header =
&amp; Footer section).</h3>
<h3 data-start=3D"364" data-end=3D"427">=F0=9F=94=B9 Step 4: Choose where y=
ou want the page number to appear:</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"428" data-end=3D"600">
