</li>
<li data-start=3D"921" data-end=3D"988">
<p data-start=3D"924" data-end=3D"988">Go to <strong data-start=3D"930" dat=
a-end=3D"961">Layout &gt; Breaks &gt; Next Page</strong> to insert a sectio=
n break.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"989" data-end=3D"1069">
<p data-start=3D"992" data-end=3D"1069">Double-click the header/footer area=
