<p data-start=3D"1123" data-end=3D"1176">Go to <strong data-start=3D"1129" =
data-end=3D"1175">Insert &gt; Page Number &gt; Format Page Numbers</strong>=
.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1177" data-end=3D"1232">
<p data-start=3D"1180" data-end=3D"1232">Set <strong data-start=3D"1184" da=
