ll break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start=3D"0" data-end=3D"=
246">Great! Here's how to set up <strong data-start=3D"28" data-end=3D"68">=
Roman numerals for preliminary pages</strong> (like Abstract, Acknowledgeme=
nt, Table of Contents) and <strong data-start=3D"125" data-end=3D"184">norm=
al Arabic numbers (1, 2, 3...) for the main content</strong> (like Introduc=
tion, Methodology, etc.) in <strong data-start=3D"227" data-end=3D"245">Mic=
rosoft Word</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"248" data-end=3D"251">
<h2 data-start=3D"253" data-end=3D"264">=F0=9F=8E=AF Goal:</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"265" data-end=3D"438">
<li data-start=3D"265" data-end=3D"331">
<p data-start=3D"267" data-end=3D"331">Use <strong data-start=3D"271" data-=
end=3D"305">Roman numerals (i, ii, iii...)</strong> for the <strong data-st=
art=3D"314" data-end=3D"330">front matter</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"332" data-end=3D"438">
<p data-start=3D"334" data-end=3D"438">Start <strong data-start=3D"340" dat=
a-end=3D"371">Arabic numbers (1, 2, 3...)</strong> from the <strong data-st=
art=3D"381" data-end=3D"397">main content</strong>, typically starting with=
 "Introduction".</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"440" data-end=3D"443">
<h2 data-start=3D"445" data-end=3D"476">=E2=9C=85 Step-by-Step Instructions=
:</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"478" data-end=3D"514">=F0=9F=94=B9 Step 1: Insert Section=
 Breaks</h3>
<ol data-start=3D"515" data-end=3D"749">
<li data-start=3D"515" data-end=3D"596">
<p data-start=3D"518" data-end=3D"596">Go to the end of your <strong data-s=
tart=3D"540" data-end=3D"561">preliminary pages</strong> (e.g., after "Tabl=
e of Contents").</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"597" data-end=3D"655">
<p data-start=3D"600" data-end=3D"655">Place your cursor <strong data-start=
=3D"618" data-end=3D"641">after the last word</strong> on that page.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"656" data-end=3D"749">
<p data-start=3D"659" data-end=3D"749">Go to the <strong data-start=3D"669"=
 data-end=3D"679">Layout</strong> tab =E2=86=92 click <strong data-start=3D=
"692" data-end=3D"702">Breaks</strong> =E2=86=92 choose <strong data-start=
=3D"712" data-end=3D"725">Next Page</strong> under "Section Breaks".</p>
</li>
</ol>
<blockquote data-start=3D"751" data-end=3D"852">
<p data-start=3D"753" data-end=3D"852">=F0=9F=93=8C This separates your doc=
ument into two sections =E2=80=94 one for Roman numerals, one for Arabic nu=
mbers.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start=3D"854" data-end=3D"857">
<h3 data-start=3D"859" data-end=3D"913">=F0=9F=94=B9 Step 2: Format Prelimi=
nary Page Numbers (Roman)</h3>
<ol data-start=3D"914" data-end=3D"1206">
<li data-start=3D"914" data-end=3D"1008">
<p data-start=3D"917" data-end=3D"1008">Double-click in the <strong data-st=
art=3D"937" data-end=3D"947">footer</strong> or <strong data-start=3D"951" =
data-end=3D"961">header</strong> of the preliminary section (before the bre=
ak).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1009" data-end=3D"1065">
<p data-start=3D"1012" data-end=3D"1065">Go to <strong data-start=3D"1018" =
data-end=3D"1064">Insert &gt; Page Number &gt; Format Page Numbers</strong>=
.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1066" data-end=3D"1136">
<p data-start=3D"1069" data-end=3D"1136">Under <strong data-start=3D"1075" =
data-end=3D"1092">Number format</strong>, select <strong data-start=3D"1101=
" data-end=3D"1135">Roman numerals (i, ii, iii...)</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1137" data-end=3D"1189">
<p data-start=3D"1140" data-end=3D"1189">Under <strong data-start=3D"1146" =
data-end=3D"1164">Page numbering</strong>, choose <strong data-start=3D"117=
3" data-end=3D"1188">Start at: i</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1190" data-end=3D"1206">
<p data-start=3D"1193" data-end=3D"1206">Click <strong data-start=3D"1199" =
data-end=3D"1205">OK</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"1208" data-end=3D"1211">
<h3 data-start=3D"1213" data-end=3D"1271">=F0=9F=94=B9 Step 3: Format Main =
Section Page Numbers (1, 2, 3=E2=80=A6)</h3>
<ol data-start=3D"1272" data-end=3D"1641">
<li data-start=3D"1272" data-end=3D"1355">
<p data-start=3D"1275" data-end=3D"1355">Now scroll to the <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"1293" data-end=3D"1328">first page of your main content</strong> (aft=
er the section break).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1356" data-end=3D"1403">
<p data-start=3D"1359" data-end=3D"1403">Double-click the header/footer of =
this page.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1404" data-end=3D"1466">
<p data-start=3D"1407" data-end=3D"1466">On the Header &amp; Footer tab, <s=
trong data-start=3D"1435" data-end=3D"1465">uncheck "Link to Previous"</str=
ong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1467" data-end=3D"1523">
<p data-start=3D"1470" data-end=3D"1523">Go to <strong data-start=3D"1476" =
data-end=3D"1522">Insert &gt; Page Number &gt; Format Page Numbers</strong>=
.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1524" data-end=3D"1571">
<p data-start=3D"1527" data-end=3D"1571">Set the <strong data-start=3D"1535=
" data-end=3D"1552">Number format</strong> to <strong data-start=3D"1556" d=
ata-end=3D"1570">1, 2, 3...</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1572" data-end=3D"1624">
<p data-start=3D"1575" data-end=3D"1624">Under <strong data-start=3D"1581" =
data-end=3D"1599">Page numbering</strong>, choose <strong data-start=3D"160=
8" data-end=3D"1623">Start at: 1</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1625" data-end=3D"1641">
<p data-start=3D"1628" data-end=3D"1641">Click <strong data-start=3D"1634" =
data-end=3D"1640">OK</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"1643" data-end=3D"1646">
<h3 data-start=3D"1648" data-end=3D"1702">=F0=9F=94=B9 Step 4: Remove Unwan=
ted Page Numbers (Optional)</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1703" data-end=3D"1946">
<li data-start=3D"1703" data-end=3D"1817">
<p data-start=3D"1705" data-end=3D"1817">If you don=E2=80=99t want numbers =
on the <strong data-start=3D"1738" data-end=3D"1752">title page</strong> or=
 <strong data-start=3D"1756" data-end=3D"1771">certificate</strong>, double=
-click the header/footer on that page.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1818" data-end=3D"1864">
<p data-start=3D"1820" data-end=3D"1864">Select the page number and press <=
strong data-start=3D"1853" data-end=3D"1863">Delete</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1865" data-end=3D"1946">
<p data-start=3D"1867" data-end=3D"1946">Ensure that <strong data-start=3D"=
1879" data-end=3D"1905">"Different First Page"</strong> is checked in the H=
eader &amp; Footer Tools.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1948" data-end=3D"1951">
<h2 data-start=3D"1953" data-end=3D"1969">=F0=9F=93=8C Final Tip:</h2>
<p data-start=3D"1970" data-end=3D"1989">To make it clearer:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1990" data-end=3D"2130">
<li data-start=3D"1990" data-end=3D"2061">
<p data-start=3D"1992" data-end=3D"2061"><strong data-start=3D"1992" data-e=
nd=3D"2005">Section 1</strong>: Title, Abstract, Acknowledgement, TOC =E2=
=86=92 Roman numerals</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2062" data-end=3D"2130">
<p data-start=3D"2064" data-end=3D"2130"><strong data-start=3D"2064" data-e=
nd=3D"2077">Section 2</strong>: Main Report (Introduction onward) =E2=86=92=
 Arabic numerals</p>
</li>
</ul>
