</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"306" data-end=3D"352">=F0=9F=94=B9 Step 2: Go to the Head=
er &amp; Footer Tools</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"353" data-end=3D"507">
<li data-start=3D"353" data-end=3D"507">
<p data-start=3D"355" data-end=3D"507">After opening the header/footer, you=
=E2=80=99ll see a new tab at the top:<br data-start=3D"420" data-end=3D"423=
