</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"509" data-end=3D"550">=F0=9F=94=B9 Step 3: Click <strong =
data-start=3D"530" data-end=3D"550">Link to Previous</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"551" data-end=3D"762">
<li data-start=3D"551" data-end=3D"625">
<p data-start=3D"553" data-end=3D"625">In the <strong data-start=3D"560" da=
ta-end=3D"574">Navigation</strong> group on the ribbon, click <strong data-=
start=3D"602" data-end=3D"624">=E2=80=9CLink to Previous=E2=80=9D</strong>.=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"626" data-end=3D"677">
<p data-start=3D"628" data-end=3D"677">When it's ON, the button will be <st=
rong data-start=3D"661" data-end=3D"676">highlighted</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"678" data-end=3D"762">
<p data-start=3D"680" data-end=3D"762">This <strong data-start=3D"685" data=
-end=3D"718">re-links the header or footer</strong> of the current section =
to the previous one.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<blockquote data-start=3D"764" data-end=3D"844">
<p data-start=3D"766" data-end=3D"844">=F0=9F=9F=A1 <strong data-start=3D"7=
69" data-end=3D"778">Note:</strong> If "Link to Previous" is already highli=
ghted, that means it=E2=80=99s ON.</p>
</blockquote>
