</li>
<li data-start=3D"491" data-end=3D"551">
<p data-start=3D"493" data-end=3D"551">Under <strong data-start=3D"499" dat=
a-end=3D"508">Views</strong>, make sure <strong data-start=3D"520" data-end=
=3D"536">Print Layout</strong> is selected =E2=9C=85.</p>
