=3D"624" data-end=3D"662">Header &amp; Footer Tools =E2=86=92 Design tab</s=
trong>:</p>
<ol data-start=3D"665" data-end=3D"936">
<li data-start=3D"665" data-end=3D"757">
<p data-start=3D"668" data-end=3D"757"><strong data-start=3D"668" data-end=
=3D"684">Double-click</strong> at the very <strong data-start=3D"697" data-=
end=3D"704">top</strong> (for header) or <strong data-start=3D"721" data-en=
d=3D"731">bottom</strong> (for footer) of the page.</p>
