tep guide:</p>
<hr data-start=3D"220" data-end=3D"223">
<h2 data-start=3D"225" data-end=3D"238">=F0=9F=8E=AF Goal:</h2>
<p data-start=3D"239" data-end=3D"360">Start page numbering from <strong da=
ta-start=3D"265" data-end=3D"276">page 10</strong>, with page number <stron=
g data-start=3D"295" data-end=3D"300">1</strong> starting from that page (a=
nd no page numbers on pages 1=E2=80=939).</p>
<hr data-start=3D"362" data-end=3D"365">
<h2 data-start=3D"367" data-end=3D"398">=E2=9C=85 Step-by-Step Instructions=
:</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"400" data-end=3D"453">=F0=9F=94=B9 Step 1: Place Your Cur=
sor at the End of Page 9</h3>
<ol data-start=3D"454" data-end=3D"608">
<li data-start=3D"454" data-end=3D"543">
<p data-start=3D"457" data-end=3D"543">Scroll to the <strong data-start=3D"=
471" data-end=3D"488">end of page 9</strong> (the last page before you want=
 page numbers to start).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"544" data-end=3D"608">
<p data-start=3D"547" data-end=3D"608">Place your <strong data-start=3D"558=
" data-end=3D"579">cursor at the end</strong> of the content on that page.<=
/p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"610" data-end=3D"613">
<h3 data-start=3D"615" data-end=3D"652">=F0=9F=94=B9 Step 2: Insert a Secti=
on Break</h3>
<ol data-start=3D"653" data-end=3D"769">
<li data-start=3D"653" data-end=3D"697">
<p data-start=3D"656" data-end=3D"697">Go to the <strong data-start=3D"666"=
