<li data-start=3D"698" data-end=3D"718">
<p data-start=3D"701" data-end=3D"718">Click <strong data-start=3D"707" dat=
a-end=3D"717">Breaks</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"719" data-end=3D"769">
<p data-start=3D"722" data-end=3D"769">Under <strong data-start=3D"728" dat=
a-end=3D"746">Section Breaks</strong>, choose <strong data-start=3D"755" da=
ta-end=3D"768">Next Page</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<blockquote data-start=3D"771" data-end=3D"824">
<p data-start=3D"773" data-end=3D"824">=E2=9C=85 This creates a new section=
 starting from page 10.</p>
