<p data-start=3D"23" data-end=3D"284">=E2=9C=85 Use <strong data-start=3D"2=
9" data-end=3D"63">Roman numerals (i, ii, iii, =E2=80=A6)</strong> for the =
<strong data-start=3D"72" data-end=3D"89">first 9 pages</strong> (like abst=
ract, TOC, etc.)<br data-start=3D"116" data-end=3D"119">
=E2=9C=85 Use <strong data-start=3D"127" data-end=3D"158">Arabic numbers (1=
, 2, 3, =E2=80=A6)</strong> starting from <strong data-start=3D"173" data-e=
nd=3D"184">page 10</strong>, which is typically the main content (like "Int=
roduction")<br data-start=3D"243" data-end=3D"246">
=E2=9C=85 Make <strong data-start=3D"255" data-end=3D"284">page 10 display =
as Page 1</strong></p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start=3D"286" data-end=3D"369">Here=E2=80=99s the <strong data-star=
