<li data-start=3D"563" data-end=3D"658">
<p data-start=3D"566" data-end=3D"658">Go to the <strong data-start=3D"576"=
 data-end=3D"586">Layout</strong> tab =E2=86=92 Click <strong data-start=3D=
"599" data-end=3D"609">Breaks</strong> =E2=86=92 Select <strong data-start=
=3D"619" data-end=3D"632">Next Page</strong> (under <em data-start=3D"640" =
data-end=3D"656">Section Breaks</em>).</p>
</li>
</ol>
<blockquote data-start=3D"660" data-end=3D"710">
<p data-start=3D"662" data-end=3D"710">=E2=9C=85 Now page 10 is the start o=
