oft Word 2019</strong>, depending on what kind of page you're trying to rem=
ove:</p>
<hr data-start=3D"119" data-end=3D"122">
<h2 data-start=3D"124" data-end=3D"167">=F0=9F=A7=B9 1. <strong data-start=
=3D"133" data-end=3D"167">Remove a Blank Page at the End</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"168" data-end=3D"263">This usually happens when there=E2=
=80=99s an <strong data-start=3D"205" data-end=3D"224">extra paragraph</str=
ong>, <strong data-start=3D"226" data-end=3D"240">page break</strong>, or <=
strong data-start=3D"245" data-end=3D"262">section break</strong>.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"265" data-end=3D"277">=E2=9C=85 Steps:</h3>
<ol data-start=3D"278" data-end=3D"568">
<li data-start=3D"278" data-end=3D"366">
<p data-start=3D"281" data-end=3D"366">Press <strong data-start=3D"287" dat=
a-end=3D"307">Ctrl + Shift + 8</strong> (or click =C2=B6 on the <strong dat=
a-start=3D"327" data-end=3D"335">Home</strong> tab) to show formatting mark=
s.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"367" data-end=3D"395">
<p data-start=3D"370" data-end=3D"395">Go to the <strong data-start=3D"380"=
 data-end=3D"394">blank page</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"396" data-end=3D"498">
<p data-start=3D"399" data-end=3D"418">Delete any visible:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"422" data-end=3D"498">
<li data-start=3D"422" data-end=3D"453">
<p data-start=3D"424" data-end=3D"453"><strong data-start=3D"424" data-end=
=3D"449">Empty paragraph marks</strong> (=C2=B6)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"457" data-end=3D"474">
<p data-start=3D"459" data-end=3D"474"><strong data-start=3D"459" data-end=
=3D"474">Page breaks</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"478" data-end=3D"498">
<p data-start=3D"480" data-end=3D"498"><strong data-start=3D"480" data-end=
=3D"498">Section breaks</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"499" data-end=3D"568">
<p data-start=3D"502" data-end=3D"568">Press <strong data-start=3D"508" dat=
a-end=3D"521">Backspace</strong> or <strong data-start=3D"525" data-end=3D"=
535">Delete</strong> until the blank page disappears.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"570" data-end=3D"573">
<h2 data-start=3D"575" data-end=3D"614">=F0=9F=93=9D 2. <strong data-start=
=3D"584" data-end=3D"614">Delete a Page with Content</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"615" data-end=3D"660">If the page contains text, tables, o=
r images:</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"662" data-end=3D"674">=E2=9C=85 Steps:</h3>
<ol data-start=3D"675" data-end=3D"779">
<li data-start=3D"675" data-end=3D"741">
<p data-start=3D"678" data-end=3D"741"><strong data-start=3D"678" data-end=
=3D"696">Click and drag</strong> your mouse to select everything on the pag=
e.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"742" data-end=3D"779">
<p data-start=3D"745" data-end=3D"779">Press <strong data-start=3D"751" dat=
a-end=3D"761">Delete</strong> on your keyboard.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"781" data-end=3D"784">
<h2 data-start=3D"786" data-end=3D"828">=F0=9F=93=84 3. <strong data-start=
=3D"795" data-end=3D"828">Delete a Specific Page Number</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"829" data-end=3D"897">If you only want to remove the <stro=
ng data-start=3D"860" data-end=3D"875">page number</strong> (not the whole =
page):</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"899" data-end=3D"911">=E2=9C=85 Steps:</h3>
<ol data-start=3D"912" data-end=3D"1208">
<li data-start=3D"912" data-end=3D"978">
<p data-start=3D"915" data-end=3D"978"><strong data-start=3D"915" data-end=
=3D"931">Double-click</strong> the header or footer where the number appear=
s.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"979" data-end=3D"1026">
<p data-start=3D"982" data-end=3D"1026">Select the page number and press <s=
trong data-start=3D"1015" data-end=3D"1025">Delete</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1027" data-end=3D"1208">
<p data-start=3D"1030" data-end=3D"1100">If you want to <strong data-start=
=3D"1045" data-end=3D"1085">remove the number from one page only</strong>, =
make sure to:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1104" data-end=3D"1208">
<li data-start=3D"1104" data-end=3D"1149">
<p data-start=3D"1106" data-end=3D"1149">Insert a <strong data-start=3D"111=
5" data-end=3D"1132">section break</strong> before/after it.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1153" data-end=3D"1208">
<p data-start=3D"1155" data-end=3D"1208">Turn off <strong data-start=3D"116=
4" data-end=3D"1186">=E2=80=9CLink to Previous=E2=80=9D</strong> in the hea=
der/footer.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"1210" data-end=3D"1213">
<h2 data-start=3D"1215" data-end=3D"1247">=F0=9F=A7=B0 4. <strong data-star=
t=3D"1224" data-end=3D"1247">Delete a Page Break</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"1248" data-end=3D"1293">Page breaks force content onto the=
 next page.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"1295" data-end=3D"1307">=E2=9C=85 Steps:</h3>
<ol data-start=3D"1308" data-end=3D"1432">
<li data-start=3D"1308" data-end=3D"1365">
<p data-start=3D"1311" data-end=3D"1365">Press <strong data-start=3D"1317" =
data-end=3D"1337">Ctrl + Shift + 8</strong> to reveal formatting marks.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1366" data-end=3D"1398">
<p data-start=3D"1369" data-end=3D"1398">Find the <strong data-start=3D"137=
8" data-end=3D"1392">Page Break</strong> text.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1399" data-end=3D"1432">
<p data-start=3D"1402" data-end=3D"1432">Click it and press <strong data-st=
art=3D"1421" data-end=3D"1431">Delete</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"1434" data-end=3D"1437">
<h2 data-start=3D"1439" data-end=3D"1457">=E2=9A=A0=EF=B8=8F Still Stuck?</=
