e 10, here=E2=80=99s how you can <strong data-start=3D"141" data-end=3D"158=
">remove a page</strong> or <strong data-start=3D"162" data-end=3D"183">fix=
 common issues</strong> related to this kind of setup:</p>
<hr data-start=3D"216" data-end=3D"219">
<h2 data-start=3D"221" data-end=3D"299">If You Want to <strong data-start=
=3D"239" data-end=3D"265">Remove a Specific Page</strong> (e.g., a blank or=
 unwanted page):</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"301" data-end=3D"336">Step 1: Show formatting marks</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"337" data-end=3D"422">
<li data-start=3D"337" data-end=3D"422">
<p data-start=3D"339" data-end=3D"422">Press <strong data-start=3D"345" dat=
a-end=3D"365">Ctrl + Shift + 8</strong> to see paragraph marks (=C2=B6), pa=
ge breaks, section breaks.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"424" data-end=3D"453">Step 2: Locate the page</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"454" data-end=3D"494">
<li data-start=3D"454" data-end=3D"494">
<p data-start=3D"456" data-end=3D"494">Scroll to the page you want to remov=
e.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"496" data-end=3D"535">Step 3: Delete content and breaks</=
h3>
<ul data-start=3D"536" data-end=3D"694">
<li data-start=3D"536" data-end=3D"608">
<p data-start=3D"538" data-end=3D"608">Select all content on that page and =
press <strong data-start=3D"580" data-end=3D"590">Delete</strong> or <stron=
g data-start=3D"594" data-end=3D"607">Backspace</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"609" data-end=3D"694">
<p data-start=3D"611" data-end=3D"694">Also delete any <strong data-start=
=3D"627" data-end=3D"642">page breaks</strong> or <strong data-start=3D"646=
" data-end=3D"664">section breaks</strong> that may cause an extra page.</p=
>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"696" data-end=3D"730">Step 4: Check section breaks</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"731" data-end=3D"917">
<li data-start=3D"731" data-end=3D"836">
<p data-start=3D"733" data-end=3D"836">If the page is caused by a section b=
reak, removing the break may affect your numbering, so be cautious.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"837" data-end=3D"917">
<p data-start=3D"839" data-end=3D"917">If you delete a section break, you m=
ay need to reapply page numbering formats.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"919" data-end=3D"922">
<h2 data-start=3D"924" data-end=3D"986">If You Want to <strong data-start=
=3D"942" data-end=3D"985">Remove Page Number from a Specific Page</strong>:=
</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"988" data-end=3D"1149">
<li data-start=3D"988" data-end=3D"1034">
<p data-start=3D"990" data-end=3D"1034">Double-click the header/footer on t=
hat page.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1035" data-end=3D"1105">
<p data-start=3D"1037" data-end=3D"1105">Turn OFF <strong data-start=3D"104=
6" data-end=3D"1066">Link to Previous</strong> in <strong data-start=3D"107=
0" data-end=3D"1104">Header &amp; Footer Tools &gt; Design</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1106" data-end=3D"1149">
<p data-start=3D"1108" data-end=3D"1149">Delete the page number on that pag=
e only.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1151" data-end=3D"1154">
<h2 data-start=3D"1156" data-end=3D"1201">If You Have a Blank Page Between =
Sections:</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"1203" data-end=3D"1377">
<li data-start=3D"1203" data-end=3D"1271">
<p data-start=3D"1205" data-end=3D"1271">Blank pages often happen because o=
f a <strong data-start=3D"1243" data-end=3D"1270">Next Page Section Break</=
strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1272" data-end=3D"1374">
<p data-start=3D"1274" data-end=3D"1374">You can try changing the <strong d=
ata-start=3D"1299" data-end=3D"1316">Section Break</strong> type to <strong=
 data-start=3D"1325" data-end=3D"1339">Continuous</strong> if you want to a=
void a blank page.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1378" data-end=3D"1391">To do this:</p>
<ol data-start=3D"1392" data-end=3D"1557">
<li data-start=3D"1392" data-end=3D"1419">
<p data-start=3D"1395" data-end=3D"1419">Show formatting marks.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1420" data-end=3D"1454">
<p data-start=3D"1423" data-end=3D"1454">Click the section break line.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1455" data-end=3D"1477">
<p data-start=3D"1458" data-end=3D"1477">Press <strong data-start=3D"1464" =
data-end=3D"1474">Delete</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1478" data-end=3D"1557">
<p data-start=3D"1481" data-end=3D"1557">Go to <strong data-start=3D"1487" =
data-end=3D"1519">Layout &gt; Breaks &gt; Continuous</strong> to insert a c=
ontinuous break instead.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"1559" data-end=3D"1562">
<h2 data-start=3D"1564" data-end=3D"1577">Summary:</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"1578" data-end=3D"1789">
<li data-start=3D"1578" data-end=3D"1640">
<p data-start=3D"1580" data-end=3D"1640">To <strong data-start=3D"1583" dat=
a-end=3D"1599">remove pages</strong>, delete content + breaks on that page.=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1641" data-end=3D"1720">
<p data-start=3D"1643" data-end=3D"1720">To <strong data-start=3D"1646" dat=
a-end=3D"1669">remove page numbers</strong>, unlink sections and delete num=
bers selectively.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1721" data-end=3D"1789">
<p data-start=3D"1723" data-end=3D"1789">To <strong data-start=3D"1726" dat=
