full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start=3D"0" data-end=
=3D"154">Yes! In Word, you <strong data-start=3D"18" data-end=3D"25">can</s=
trong> use uppercase Roman numerals like <strong data-start=3D"60" data-end=
=3D"77">I, II, III...</strong> for page numbers instead of lowercase (i, ii=
, iii). Here=E2=80=99s how to set it up:</p>
<hr data-start=3D"156" data-end=3D"159">
<h2 data-start=3D"161" data-end=3D"247">How to Insert Uppercase Roman Numer=
als (I, II, III...) as Page Numbers in Word 2019</h2>
<ol data-start=3D"249" data-end=3D"772">
<li data-start=3D"249" data-end=3D"326">
<p data-start=3D"252" data-end=3D"326"><strong data-start=3D"252" data-end=
=3D"268">Double-click</strong> the header or footer area where you want the=
 page number.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"327" data-end=3D"383">
<p data-start=3D"330" data-end=3D"383">Go to <strong data-start=3D"336" dat=
a-end=3D"382">Insert &gt; Page Number &gt; Format Page Numbers</strong>.</p=
>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"384" data-end=3D"591">
<p data-start=3D"387" data-end=3D"424">In the <strong data-start=3D"394" da=
ta-end=3D"416">Page Number Format</strong> dialog:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"428" data-end=3D"591">
<li data-start=3D"428" data-end=3D"475">
<p data-start=3D"430" data-end=3D"475">Click the dropdown next to <strong d=
ata-start=3D"457" data-end=3D"474">Number format</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"479" data-end=3D"535">
<p data-start=3D"481" data-end=3D"535">Choose <strong data-start=3D"488" da=
ta-end=3D"507">I, II, III, ...</strong> (uppercase Roman numerals).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"539" data-end=3D"591">
<p data-start=3D"541" data-end=3D"591">Set <strong data-start=3D"545" data-=
end=3D"558">Start at:</strong> to <code data-start=3D"562" data-end=3D"565"=
>I</code> (or any number you want).</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"592" data-end=3D"608">
<p data-start=3D"595" data-end=3D"608">Click <strong data-start=3D"601" dat=
a-end=3D"607">OK</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"609" data-end=3D"706">
<p data-start=3D"612" data-end=3D"706">Insert the page number by clicking <=
strong data-start=3D"647" data-end=3D"688">Insert &gt; Page Number &gt; Bot=
tom of Page</strong> (choose a style).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"707" data-end=3D"772">
<p data-start=3D"710" data-end=3D"772">The page numbers will now display as=
 uppercase Roman numerals.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"774" data-end=3D"777">
<h3 data-start=3D"779" data-end=3D"788">Tips:</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"789" data-end=3D"972">
<li data-start=3D"789" data-end=3D"880">
<p data-start=3D"791" data-end=3D"880">You can do this separately for diffe=
rent sections if your document has multiple sections.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"881" data-end=3D"972">
<p data-start=3D"883" data-end=3D"972">To switch later to Arabic numerals (=
1, 2, 3...), repeat the steps and choose that format.</p>
</li>
</ul>
