<ol data-start=3D"330" data-end=3D"564">
<li data-start=3D"330" data-end=3D"417">
<p data-start=3D"333" data-end=3D"417">Go to the end of <strong data-start=
=3D"350" data-end=3D"360">page 6</strong> (place your cursor at the end of =
the content on page 6).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"418" data-end=3D"564">
<p data-start=3D"421" data-end=3D"510">Go to <strong data-start=3D"427" dat=
a-end=3D"437">Layout</strong> tab =E2=86=92 Click <strong data-start=3D"450=
" data-end=3D"460">Breaks</strong> =E2=86=92 Under <strong data-start=3D"46=
9" data-end=3D"487">Section Breaks</strong>, choose <strong data-start=3D"4=
96" data-end=3D"509">Next Page</strong>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"518" data-end=3D"564">This creates a new section starting =
at page 7.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"566" data-end=3D"569">
<h3 data-start=3D"571" data-end=3D"633">Step 2: Unlink Headers/Footers of S=
ection 2 from Section 1</h3>
<ol data-start=3D"635" data-end=3D"868">
<li data-start=3D"635" data-end=3D"655">
<p data-start=3D"638" data-end=3D"655">Go to <strong data-start=3D"644" dat=
a-end=3D"654">page 7</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"656" data-end=3D"713">
<p data-start=3D"659" data-end=3D"713">Double-click the <strong data-start=
=3D"676" data-end=3D"696">header or footer</strong> area to open it.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"714" data-end=3D"868">
<p data-start=3D"717" data-end=3D"868">On the <strong data-start=3D"724" da=
