 data-start=3D"768" data-end=3D"788">Link to Previous</strong> to turn it <=
strong data-start=3D"800" data-end=3D"807">OFF</strong> (unlink this sectio=
n=E2=80=99s header/footer from the previous one).</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"870" data-end=3D"873">
<h3 data-start=3D"875" data-end=3D"937">Step 3: Remove Page Numbers from Fi=
rst Section (Pages 1=E2=80=936)</h3>
