<li data-start=3D"939" data-end=3D"983">
<p data-start=3D"942" data-end=3D"983">Go to the <strong data-start=3D"952"=
 data-end=3D"969">header/footer</strong> on pages 1=E2=80=936.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"984" data-end=3D"1078">
<p data-start=3D"987" data-end=3D"1078">Select the page number and delete i=
