</li>
<li data-start=3D"1061" data-end=3D"1242">
<p data-start=3D"1064" data-end=3D"1242">In the <strong data-start=3D"1071"=
 data-end=3D"1105">Header &amp; Footer Tools &gt; Design</strong> tab, clic=
k <strong data-start=3D"1117" data-end=3D"1137">Link to Previous</strong> t=
o <strong data-start=3D"1141" data-end=3D"1156">turn it OFF</strong>.<br da=
ta-start=3D"1157" data-end=3D"1160">
<em data-start=3D"1163" data-end=3D"1242">(This breaks the connection betwe=
en section 1 and section 2 headers/footers.)</em></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1243" data-end=3D"1303">
<p data-start=3D"1246" data-end=3D"1303">Now go to <strong data-start=3D"12=
56" data-end=3D"1302">Insert &gt; Page Number &gt; Format Page Numbers</str=
ong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1304" data-end=3D"1414">
<p data-start=3D"1307" data-end=3D"1321">In the dialog:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1325" data-end=3D"1414">
<li data-start=3D"1325" data-end=3D"1386">
<p data-start=3D"1327" data-end=3D"1386">Choose <strong data-start=3D"1334"=
 data-end=3D"1352">Number format:</strong> <code data-start=3D"1353" data-e=
nd=3D"1367">1, 2, 3, ...</code> (Arabic numerals).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1390" data-end=3D"1414">
<p data-start=3D"1392" data-end=3D"1414">Set <strong data-start=3D"1396" da=
ta-end=3D"1409">Start at:</strong> <code data-start=3D"1410" data-end=3D"14=
13">1</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1415" data-end=3D"1431">
<p data-start=3D"1418" data-end=3D"1431">Click <strong data-start=3D"1424" =
data-end=3D"1430">OK</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1432" data-end=3D"1536">
<p data-start=3D"1435" data-end=3D"1536">Insert page numbers if they don=E2=
=80=99t appear: <strong data-start=3D"1477" data-end=3D"1518">Insert &gt; P=
age Number &gt; Bottom of Page</strong> and pick a style.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"1538" data-end=3D"1541">
<h3 data-start=3D"1543" data-end=3D"1569">Step 4: Check &amp; Adjust</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1571" data-end=3D"1777">
<li data-start=3D"1571" data-end=3D"1640">
<p data-start=3D"1573" data-end=3D"1640">Pages 1 to 6 should now show Roman=
 numerals: i, ii, iii, iv, v, vi.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1641" data-end=3D"1699">
<p data-start=3D"1643" data-end=3D"1699">Page 7 onwards should show Arabic =
numerals: 1, 2, 3, ...</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1700" data-end=3D"1777">
<p data-start=3D"1702" data-end=3D"1777">The numbering restarts properly be=
cause of the section break and unlinking.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1779" data-end=3D"1782">
<h3 data-start=3D"1784" data-end=3D"1799">Bonus Tips:</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1801" data-end=3D"2103">
<li data-start=3D"1801" data-end=3D"1893">
<p data-start=3D"1803" data-end=3D"1893">If page numbers don=E2=80=99t appe=
ar correctly, try deleting and reinserting them after unlinking.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1894" data-end=3D"1967">
<p data-start=3D"1896" data-end=3D"1967">You can customize header/footer co=
ntent separately in each section now.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1968" data-end=3D"2103">
<p data-start=3D"1970" data-end=3D"2103">To remove page numbers from the fi=
rst page of a section (like a title page), check <strong data-start=3D"2053=
" data-end=3D"2077">Different First Page</strong> in Header &amp; Footer To=
ols.</p>
</li>
</ul>
