rose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p da=
ta-start=3D"0" data-end=3D"148">If you want to <strong data-start=3D"15" da=
ta-end=3D"61">remove page numbers from the first 6 pages</strong> but keep =
numbering starting from page 7 onward, here=E2=80=99s how you can do it in =
Word 2019:</p>
<hr data-start=3D"150" data-end=3D"153">
<h3 data-start=3D"155" data-end=3D"216">Step-by-Step: Remove Page Numbers f=
rom First 6 Pages Only</h3>
<hr data-start=3D"218" data-end=3D"221">
<h3 data-start=3D"223" data-end=3D"273">1. Insert a Section Break at the En=
d of Page 6</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"275" data-end=3D"474">
<li data-start=3D"275" data-end=3D"320">
<p data-start=3D"277" data-end=3D"320">Place your cursor at the end of <str=
ong data-start=3D"309" data-end=3D"319">page 6</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"321" data-end=3D"384">
<p data-start=3D"323" data-end=3D"384">Go to <strong data-start=3D"329" dat=
a-end=3D"360">Layout &gt; Breaks &gt; Next Page</strong> (under Section Bre=
aks).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"385" data-end=3D"474">
<p data-start=3D"387" data-end=3D"415">This creates two sections:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"418" data-end=3D"474">
<li data-start=3D"418" data-end=3D"443">
<p data-start=3D"420" data-end=3D"443">Section 1 =E2=86=92 pages 1=E2=80=93=
6</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"446" data-end=3D"474">
<p data-start=3D"448" data-end=3D"474">Section 2 =E2=86=92 page 7 onwards</=
p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"476" data-end=3D"479">
<h3 data-start=3D"481" data-end=3D"533">2. Unlink Section 2 Header/Footer f=
rom Section 1</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"535" data-end=3D"809">
<li data-start=3D"535" data-end=3D"575">
<p data-start=3D"537" data-end=3D"575">Go to <strong data-start=3D"543" dat=
a-end=3D"553">page 7</strong> (start of Section 2).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"576" data-end=3D"628">
<p data-start=3D"578" data-end=3D"628">Double-click the header or footer ar=
ea to edit it.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"629" data-end=3D"809">
<p data-start=3D"631" data-end=3D"809">In the <strong data-start=3D"638" da=
ta-end=3D"672">Header &amp; Footer Tools &gt; Design</strong> tab, click <s=
trong data-start=3D"684" data-end=3D"704">Link to Previous</strong> to <str=
ong data-start=3D"708" data-end=3D"723">turn it OFF</strong>.<br data-start=
=3D"724" data-end=3D"727">
<em data-start=3D"729" data-end=3D"809">(This breaks the connection so page=
 numbers can be different in each section.)</em></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"811" data-end=3D"814">
<h3 data-start=3D"816" data-end=3D"869">3. Remove Page Numbers from Section=
 1 (Pages 1-6)</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"871" data-end=3D"1062">
<li data-start=3D"871" data-end=3D"919">
<p data-start=3D"873" data-end=3D"919">Go to <strong data-start=3D"879" dat=
a-end=3D"892">pages 1=E2=80=936</strong> (Section 1 header/footer).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"920" data-end=3D"961">
<p data-start=3D"922" data-end=3D"961">Double-click to open the header/foot=
er.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"962" data-end=3D"1005">
<p data-start=3D"964" data-end=3D"1005">Select the page number and <strong =
data-start=3D"991" data-end=3D"1004">delete it</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1006" data-end=3D"1062">
<p data-start=3D"1008" data-end=3D"1062">This removes page numbers only fro=
m the first section.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1064" data-end=3D"1067">
<h3 data-start=3D"1069" data-end=3D"1125">4. Format Page Numbers in Section=
 2 (Page 7 Onwards)</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1127" data-end=3D"1355">
<li data-start=3D"1127" data-end=3D"1160">
<p data-start=3D"1129" data-end=3D"1160">Go to <strong data-start=3D"1135" =
data-end=3D"1145">page 7</strong> header/footer.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1161" data-end=3D"1232">
<p data-start=3D"1163" data-end=3D"1232">Insert or format page numbers as n=
eeded (Arabic or Roman numerals).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1233" data-end=3D"1355">
<p data-start=3D"1235" data-end=3D"1247">If needed:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1250" data-end=3D"1355">
<li data-start=3D"1250" data-end=3D"1300">
<p data-start=3D"1252" data-end=3D"1300"><strong data-start=3D"1252" data-e=
nd=3D"1298">Insert &gt; Page Number &gt; Format Page Numbers</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1303" data-end=3D"1355">
<p data-start=3D"1305" data-end=3D"1355">Set <strong data-start=3D"1309" da=
ta-end=3D"1322">Start at:</strong> 1 (or whatever number you want).</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1357" data-end=3D"1360">
<h3 data-start=3D"1362" data-end=3D"1370">Now:</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1372" data-end=3D"1462">
<li data-start=3D"1372" data-end=3D"1411">
<p data-start=3D"1374" data-end=3D"1411">Pages 1=E2=80=936 have <strong dat=
a-start=3D"1389" data-end=3D"1408">no page numbers</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1412" data-end=3D"1462">
<p data-start=3D"1414" data-end=3D"1462">Page 7 onward shows page numbers s=
tarting fresh.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1464" data-end=3D"1467">
<p data-start=3D"1469" data-end=3D"1635">If you want those first 6 pages to=
 have <strong data-start=3D"1509" data-end=3D"1546">Roman numerals instead =
of numbers</strong> (like i to vi), just format Section 1 page numbers acco=
rdingly instead of deleting them.</p>
